{"id":"wrack","lemma":"Wrack","pos":"noun","rank":4513,"glosses":["wreck (damaged remains of a ship, airplane, etc.)","wreck (physically and/or mentally unstable person)"],"ipa":"/vʁak/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/7d/De-Wrack.ogg/De-Wrack.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Wracks","plural":"Wracks"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich bin ein völliges Wrack.","en":"I'm a total wreck.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/393087","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"completely","l":"völlig"},null]},{"text":"Er ist ein vollkommenes Wrack.","en":"He's a total wreck.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},null,null]},{"text":"Du bist ein nervliches Wrack.","en":"You're a nervous wreck.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},null,null]},{"text":"Eine Flugbegleiterin wurde aus dem Wrack gerettet.","en":"A stewardess was rescued from the wreck.","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"flight attendant"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"out of / from"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"to save, to rescue","l":"retten"}]},{"text":"Wir konnten nicht viel aus dem Wrack bergen.","en":"There wasn't much we could salvage from the wreckage.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"much, a lot"},{"g":"out of / from"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"to recover"}]}]}